cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use OCRSD in your research, please cite it with the metadata in this file."
type: software
title: "OCRSD: Open Civil Registry Synthetic Dataset"
abstract: >-
  OCRSD generates synthetic Brazilian civil registry documents with ground
  truth for OCR research. It maps the fields of PDF templates, fills them with
  coherent fictitious data in handwritten, neural or typed styles, and adds
  scan effects. It also compares OCR engines and redacts fields in PDFs.
authors:
